#: scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9b43b496f7833caca48bf47235dca3399ef51a9a0fee29ff4b9878040adef1a
#. default-sha256: cb4f4592fc32cf47171a85e2bbf14362ec81f842aa422c1022323ee044d8cace
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Before long, winter retreated and our second spring came "
"to take its place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫不久，⟪k:8⟫冬雪消融——第二年的春天来临。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d9cda46bff38236d4310620d25b77d2483f507b0aede848e8ba9d62dfb54724
#. default-sha256: 232e75f007a09cedf690d45e7aafe9276048053f138cf7e4f58295ea973043a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A full year had passed since we had resumed living together,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她和我重新生活在一起，⟪k:1⟫也已悄然过去了一个春秋。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae2ff977b4d7843f2ee7cd259ecbf0df3b8a81cea4f5ccfc821dc060d58f6e7d
#. default-sha256: 6535dd46a04bf1ac58827d76b1ea365e56438d2b825791c1f12f41df9eb3f367
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I don’t think it was my imagination that this year felt much warmer than last."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫与前一年不同的是，今年的春天要暖和很多。⟪k:1⟫恐怕，⟪k:2⟫那不是错觉。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62747eaaa88e320c94d23e73c8c6c1cb21710996cbe333eed21e40db3050df0f
#. default-sha256: eb8c65be8d4489ba1c4d74ea5158ed54e47fe8c7424b2323e7dc97adfe476d37
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One night, when the breeze carried on it a pleasant residual warmth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫或许是因为，⟪k:1⟫这个春天比往年来的更早吧。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫夜里拂过的柔和之风，⟪k:4⟫让人想起晴朗天"
"气的余韵——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8e0516f52f3d3035f0b6b5a5df00d88ad0d29ae658b8f823ffd76c64a87b737
#. default-sha256: c61ee766df7379672e26f76e89c58b69e25cb69e8566c32389f90e564a1c7fc1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Giselle escorted me out to the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫吉赛儿把我带向了花园。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afb8d4bed0386b99a6fe2186c4a09f168c8742ce405a95887ab0adbf73d9f5e5
#. default-sha256: cb30beac65be88b07c08d626a615c77b0beb5456754b66c860dfca6e0f99c042
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come on, Master! Hurry up!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫老爷！⟪k:3⟫快点，⟪k:4⟫快点啦！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d7e9e0f214eb3f48e32d807e2921cc90438f3cb0ee718ca3d61875ad40a6a65
#. default-sha256: 79688ff53ee6f1e59730b42edda268ab3aaae19ae8d80ac163cba6de11d04e1e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s the middle of the night... ⟪k:1⟫What’s so important..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫都这么晚了，⟪k:1⟫要做什么啊……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5d675fe486ae8b97f5474e756820b09bc0f7e81822f4915747c647efc003487
#. default-sha256: 6573e61026c956717719e40d60292acc43d1f2a796f9f9ca27afa5e8ec8a2293
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just found it myself!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And I couldn’t wait until morning!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那是因为，⟪k:1⟫我也才刚刚注意到嘛！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫根本等不及明天啦——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7df4e28ef3315e5e0edff45aafd87efc3c1d9ab5109e88b543535f1b5f4faf90
#. default-sha256: 66cd73ba05b87685547741af59a39303c44b266f9eace1508803de14e470c131
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48a5f2a8257f7a9a524f212861dfcdb39d11413724d3408681b8a5ca1ad10ddc
#. default-sha256: db20c30adf2616d8ca0f04f6c3e824a88c70c20b568a8922edf4ee3e7b0c8bf3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose! It blossomed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫开花了！⟪k:1⟫蔷薇开花了！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be235abe08ee0753b24a65266e8d1fb571fdde99502c8361d8fc25b7d65a1aab
#. default-sha256: ad05a8aa0b16f2ff5a0b0ef77976c12f698e06c42e85cefc7e8e04dc2b356fab
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫蔷薇………？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5c6b4327715dc9300d899f13ae4df9e23ac371a5320ebe7bc5a9e1b7201a36d
#. default-sha256: f6f50eafb098d2905754cd73da53727431aedf71b8585d5452ce70534aa88981
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle had, over the past year, cleaned up the nest of weeds that had been "
"strangling the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫从前净是杂草的花园，⟪k:3⟫这一年间也被吉赛儿修缮得焕然一新。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e8dd1471c483da7182890c61f6b2c3eb3c3bd62480739cf5128f15e295d6309
#. default-sha256: aadb5e89fb873f60fc9acaf651c99587841d30a7ff279d63b913c40bb13116bc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Off to the side of a small plot of turned soil, swaying in the wind beneath the moonlight,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在小小的田地旁，⟪k:1⟫沐浴在月光下轻轻随风摇曳的——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57726b92d9ad9ec7a2f221386db0d120b5e90114b5d4789a1c65b7e20cf9f3a1
#. default-sha256: 3a953906a93b45811d5d7d1cf72e9a4090818d5d7a53b3e7a428250d8ea25ad2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was a single red rose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是一朵红色的蔷薇。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d55daaf3f683a64a2a3915b00ecc6937934f0e03c64853771c7744eb0c6830ac
#. default-sha256: f771b0137570f217a3d30f236d7b01461c910c5ea75e55004287a193603571d0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When did you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这……⟪k:1⟫是什么时候……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1deb0d16467d7882b9e19f2c29b8b9854c114ecb837553eb3d2b406c4470818c
#. default-sha256: a2de146a5401686c14010ee455e9a56fc23158fb95a5afda462a74beaa652700
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Last year, I requested flower seeds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I just couldn’t get them to grow,⟪k:3⟫and "
"I was starting to think they never would..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫还记得一年前吗？⟪k:1⟫那时我请他们送来了花的种子。⟪k:2⟫然而它们怎么都不开花，⟪k:3⟫当时我还在想"
"「果然不行呀」，可是——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71475a882dcd9663ff8e74177dc90a604e923cad53f85bbd20d51b83373f1703
#. default-sha256: 4ca57e8b3a80a14f771992f70f64810f09b7a17c5dd9f07e5b037498b945b7e2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But look: it’s only one, but it did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你瞧。⟪k:1⟫虽然只有一朵，⟪k:2⟫但它开花了呢！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f7bc0d68611a7769e815bd50ca01dcbd230fc36d5ea23b8a60af08192410c39
#. default-sha256: 7df7c8b19b6cd1f8d27afd5ff8b0270c75211bb5730735d3a00363347d515e72
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...I had no idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………我都不知道这件事。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b25bdff77874cf69259b0ca8b2458911b41700b79a0d6f327e068b7253475bbd
#. default-sha256: 7766d955e4527012a9f34a5827a022602ec15a1c8d64d8307fab402050115a46
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course you didn’t. I didn’t tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对呀，⟪k:1⟫因为……⟪k:2⟫我没告诉你。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e4a24af5c01d2c1cd0021aa85d8a3a97ab24a9f6434adf0c2e547b6f4618623
#. default-sha256: ff950dd86ff651e2c25e714650c0d72ecf65a9b63000b62cf4258139d052f5c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why would you keep it from me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为何要把花的事保密？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2edfc4eb082ff88cefa64d272524e57dcb40f24504d5c969b81cdd505682ce3d
#. default-sha256: 8018ba1358202b6b5cdc999143b01e240680a8bc0e4831d94ae0f53be1e56306
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫to make it a gift for you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这个嘛——⟪k:1⟫因为我想等到花开时，把它送给老爷你。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa0c4bd4dd25b1911bfc417812ebbf85e530a2ab36fab467686c29c1f5a3a8cd
#. default-sha256: 7f182556a6ebf1cdc9a7de0c4226ee919e967e61761be1038bf4292005b7c92a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What...? ⟪k:1⟫Why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……哎？⟪k:1⟫………为何？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 821e1abb874478e061781525c49d729624924d196b2fc565434140d4e529d939
#. default-sha256: d87f335e84f43572f0035a9067593787d0519fd58ebb31753bb5cceeab3c0f93
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roses make wonderful gifts, supposedly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为，蔷薇——很适合作为礼物呢。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0ae798b413d41a6d77ff6a7a3396a35f6e5ed5c0f85608e96d968f6cd454f9a
#. default-sha256: 3952e06a0e7e77a585f9786b6e17d9a4eb067a41932cb4af4d455bc740b50be1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不是指这个……⟪k:1⟫我的意思是——⟪k:2⟫为何要送给我？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我明明都没有为你做过什么……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1addfe0027ffac8e67e482a7031d519ffc814cbcfe006fcdc2fa1aedf947b045
#. default-sha256: 05e97b7ebb3196a68541a020caf062b2fcc62f0048e090d3454024f5ff875df2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consider it... ⟪k:1⟫a symbol of my hope that we’ll still be this close another year from "
"now. ⟪k:2⟫If we are, then this is yours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这朵花也放入了我的愿望，当时我祈祷着……一年之后，⟪k:1⟫你我的关系能变好。⟪k:2⟫如今愿望能得以实"
"现，⟪k:3⟫这朵花当然就属于你了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 384122da978ca8ca06b2a8148de5c6787d098f7b8f5e59048476456067548d5f
#. default-sha256: 5ae454f95ef21d113e6727ca9fcb7fa3dcced09bf8d4d77aff8af2950546b294
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow her reasoning...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（我完全不明白这个理由……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 510bfec0522d50d3b4ef2670af8166f18c3e1d2bb7a974b7371596876ea83680
#. default-sha256: 8b3a595032c8bf2071328a449fe232360d9ab16c51f1e1efcd376e4b59ed55ee
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow it at all, but...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（虽然搞不懂，⟪k:1⟫但——）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7188e075294ceee37739c9ae3d6e88c83b2d69bc1f61519ce1e18db91bac862
#. default-sha256: bb08bf416de64372d463a7384e638280da0515616dd602e54c2575c06eb92a2b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...The sight of the deep red rose almost melting into the dark night was perhaps the most "
"wondrous thing I had ever seen in my life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫仿若融于黑暗夜色之中的这朵红色蔷薇，⟪k:1⟫比我至今为止所见过的任何光景都更如梦似幻。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_12F92596_4849_4E96_BC08_4A9985D500EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d068c2f04d306cc0c05e3a311e192474b54bc8e8cb1162ffa3f2c4809eaca25
